      <article class="template-card"><img src="/camera-studio.webp" alt="摄影机与胶片创作示意图" /><div class="image-shade"></div><div class="template-content"><span class="image-label">文生视频</span><h3>从一句灵感，到一个镜头。</h3><p>输入描述，无需首帧图片。</p><button class="image-button" @click="emit('action', 'draft', 'text')">使用模板<PhArrowUpRight :size="18" /></button></div><span class="image-credit">创作示意图</span></article>
